# Bulk SEC source material: re-downloadable verbatim from EDGAR, so it stays
# out of the repo. Run scripts/fetch-filings.py after cloning to hydrate.
# Everything else under data/ is evidence or curated review state and IS
# tracked - see data/README.md for the split.
/data/filings/
/data/collection/shared/sec/cik-lookup-data.txt
# Per-run caches of verbatim SEC documents (scratch/secget.py): the same class as
# /data/filings/ above, re-downloadable from EDGAR, so they stay out of the repo.
/data/collection/investors/*/scratch/sec-cache/
